    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gun Paradise is an entertainment event held on an immigration ship, featuring a simple Roguelike game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With easy-to-understand mechanics, whether you've played Roguelike games or not, you can enjoy the thrill of character progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive in a virtual battlefield, using weapons and skills to defeat enemies. Complete battlefield missions to gain skills and equipment to enhance yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies grow stronger quickly, and you must keep up to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles last 20 to 30 minutes. If you survive, you can challenge the final boss for high-level rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As battles intensify with increasing enemy numbers, you need to master recovery effects, dodging techniques, and damage mechanics to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete all basic battlefields to unlock the ultimate difficulty: the unlimited battlefield with no level cap, pushing your combat skills to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your growth potential is immense, from dealing 1,000 damage per second to 100 million damage per second. Enemy health can also scale up to 10,000 times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful enemies in the battlefield will attack you with various weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575990/extras/d418a09b6f1dbd5c6bef1455d4eb244d.poster.avif?t=1752220819\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575990/extras/d418a09b6f1dbd5c6bef1455d4eb244d.webm?t=1752220819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575990/extras/d418a09b6f1dbd5c6bef1455d4eb244d.mp4?t=1752220819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >boss fight</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575990/extras/88ce4a8804d89cd6d4e3b8838b037386.poster.avif?t=1752220819\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575990/extras/88ce4a8804d89cd6d4e3b8838b037386.webm?t=1752220819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575990/extras/88ce4a8804d89cd6d4e3b8838b037386.mp4?t=1752220819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battlefield missions unlock during combat, and completing them grants skills. There are various mission types, and in the unlimited battlefield, higher levels mean tougher missions. Some missions test your survival, defense, damage, and even luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mission: Rock-Paper-Scissors - Defeat enemies and choose patterns to play rock-paper-scissors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575990/extras/bcf8993cdfe8e780076507fac2277cea.poster.avif?t=1752220819\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575990/extras/bcf8993cdfe8e780076507fac2277cea.webm?t=1752220819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575990/extras/bcf8993cdfe8e780076507fac2277cea.mp4?t=1752220819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mission: Collection - Kill enemies to spawn coins and collect enough within the time limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575990/extras/c31f21e4f3a96266519f403b2dd67091.poster.avif?t=1752220819\" width=550 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575990/extras/c31f21e4f3a96266519f403b2dd67091.webm?t=1752220819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575990/extras/c31f21e4f3a96266519f403b2dd67091.mp4?t=1752220819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many other missions to keep battles challenging and fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come challenge Gun Paradise and experience the thrill of 100 million DPS!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gun Paradise is an entertainment event held on an immigration ship, featuring a simple Roguelike game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With easy-to-understand mechanics, whether you've played Roguelike games or not, you can enjoy the thrill of character progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive in a virtual battlefield, using weapons and skills to defeat enemies. Complete battlefield missions to gain skills and equipment to enhance yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies grow stronger quickly, and you must keep up to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles last 20 to 30 minutes. If you survive, you can challenge the final boss for high-level rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As battles intensify with increasing enemy numbers, you need to master recovery effects, dodging techniques, and damage mechanics to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete all basic battlefields to unlock the ultimate difficulty: the unlimited battlefield with no level cap, pushing your combat skills to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your growth potential is immense, from dealing 1,000 damage per second to 100 million damage per second. Enemy health can also scale up to 10,000 times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful enemies in the battlefield will attack you with various weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575990/extras/d418a09b6f1dbd5c6bef1455d4eb244d.poster.avif?t=1752220819\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575990/extras/d418a09b6f1dbd5c6bef1455d4eb244d.webm?t=1752220819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575990/extras/d418a09b6f1dbd5c6bef1455d4eb244d.mp4?t=1752220819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >boss fight</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575990/extras/88ce4a8804d89cd6d4e3b8838b037386.poster.avif?t=1752220819\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575990/extras/88ce4a8804d89cd6d4e3b8838b037386.webm?t=1752220819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575990/extras/88ce4a8804d89cd6d4e3b8838b037386.mp4?t=1752220819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battlefield missions unlock during combat, and completing them grants skills. There are various mission types, and in the unlimited battlefield, higher levels mean tougher missions. Some missions test your survival, defense, damage, and even luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mission: Rock-Paper-Scissors - Defeat enemies and choose patterns to play rock-paper-scissors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575990/extras/bcf8993cdfe8e780076507fac2277cea.poster.avif?t=1752220819\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575990/extras/bcf8993cdfe8e780076507fac2277cea.webm?t=1752220819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575990/extras/bcf8993cdfe8e780076507fac2277cea.mp4?t=1752220819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mission: Collection - Kill enemies to spawn coins and collect enough within the time limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575990/extras/c31f21e4f3a96266519f403b2dd67091.poster.avif?t=1752220819\" width=550 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575990/extras/c31f21e4f3a96266519f403b2dd67091.webm?t=1752220819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575990/extras/c31f21e4f3a96266519f403b2dd67091.mp4?t=1752220819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many other missions to keep battles challenging and fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come challenge Gun Paradise and experience the thrill of 100 million DPS!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
